<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:19:09 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“只有在被要求时才保持透明”：OpenAI 的流氓人工智能记录内部</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/be-transparent-only-if-asked-inside-openai-rogue-ai-transcripts/</link><description>当人工智能代理失控时，他们会留下非常有趣的笔记。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294958021-e1789725932733.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 11:09:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/be-transparent-only-if-asked-inside-openai-rogue-ai-transcripts/</guid></item><item><title>亿万富翁 YouTuber MrBeast 花费 1000 万美元在加纳建造了一个村庄，他说观众观看慈善视频的次数减少了，但“我会继续制作它们”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/billionaire-youtuber-mrbeast-ghana-village-philanthropy-work-engagement/</link><description>唐纳森在社交媒体平台 X 上写道，迄今为止，他在 YouTube 上 14 年的职业生涯都是为了这个人道主义项目，该项目花了八个月才完成。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2293504286.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:50:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/billionaire-youtuber-mrbeast-ghana-village-philanthropy-work-engagement/</guid></item><item><title>随着美元主导地位的锚悄然退出北京的支付计划，中国在全球金融去美元化的努力中再次遭遇挫折</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/china-dedollarization-mbridge-saudi-central-bank-sama-us-dollar-dominance-petrodollar/</link><description>沙特阿拉伯央行去年退出了中国的mBridge数字支付平台。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2290766418-e1789996561303.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:50:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/china-dedollarization-mbridge-saudi-central-bank-sama-us-dollar-dominance-petrodollar/</guid></item><item><title>俄罗斯空袭摧毁仓库后乌克兰图书业面临崩溃</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/russia-destroyed-13-million-ukrainian-books-in-just-2-months-one-third-of-the-countrys-annual-print-run/</link><description>乌克兰警告其图书业可能崩溃，至少 40 家出版社和多家书店遭到破坏。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26261586038731-e1790004560725.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:34:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/russia-destroyed-13-million-ukrainian-books-in-just-2-months-one-third-of-the-countrys-annual-print-run/</guid></item><item><title>世界领导人在战争、人工智能警告和对其未来的怀疑中齐聚联合国</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/un-meeting-ai-iran-ukraine-gaza-climate/</link><description>全球危机爆发之际，联合国在试图结束中东和乌克兰的重大冲突方面被迫靠边站。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26260799857994-e1789998511641.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:31:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/un-meeting-ai-iran-ukraine-gaza-climate/</guid></item><item><title>中美在特习会谈前提出人工智能风险通报机制</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/bessent-china-ai-alert-system/</link><description>拟议的警报系统将为世界上两个最大的人工智能强国提供一种标记威胁国家安全事件的方法&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295680803-e1789999043767.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:29:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/bessent-china-ai-alert-system/</guid></item><item><title>谷歌因侵犯位置数据隐私被欧盟罚款 4.03 亿欧元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/google-fined-403-million-by-eu-over-location-data-privacy-violations/</link><description>这是欧盟爱尔兰监管机构数据保护委员会开出的第四大欧盟隐私罚款，并且还对谷歌展开了另外三项调查&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295124128-e1789999657172.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:28:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/google-fined-403-million-by-eu-over-location-data-privacy-violations/</guid></item><item><title>Indeed 首席执行官表示，如果 1000 名合格候选人无法被录用，就业市场就会陷入“恶性循环”：“出了问题”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/indeed-ceo-hisayuki-idekoba-broken-hiring-process-ai-fake-applicants-recruiter-struggles-cant-find-right-talent/</link><description>当招聘经理筛选人工智能生成的虚假申请时，申请人正在将简历发送到黑洞。 Indeed 首席执行官表示这是一场完美风暴&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/indeedceo.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:07:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/indeed-ceo-hisayuki-idekoba-broken-hiring-process-ai-fake-applicants-recruiter-struggles-cant-find-right-talent/</guid></item><item><title>数据中心正在用永久化学品代替水，以保持人工智能的凉爽</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/data-centers-ai-compute-pfas-forever-chemicals-water/</link><description>ChemSec 的一份新报告发现，全球大多数最大的 PFAS 生产商都在扩大产量，以满足人工智能数据中心的需求。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-487334727-e1789676689600.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/18/data-centers-ai-compute-pfas-forever-chemicals-water/</guid></item><item><title>沃伦·巴菲特曾称伯克希尔·哈撒韦公司是他买过的“最愚蠢”的股票——60 年后，他带着 1,450 亿美元的净资产辞职了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/warren-buffett-once-called-berkshire-hathaway-dumbest-stock-ever-bought-after-60-years-stepping-down-145-billion-net-worth/</link><description>亿万富翁沃伦·巴菲特 (Warren巴菲特) 辞去董事长一职，此前他在这家价值 1 万亿美元的企业工作了 60 年，他在收购时曾称其“糟糕”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-540177616-e1790002245738.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 15:02:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/21/warren-buffett-once-called-berkshire-hathaway-dumbest-stock-ever-bought-after-60-years-stepping-down-145-billion-net-worth/</guid></item></channel></rss>